<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE - Baden-Wuerttemberg CPI.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE - Baden-Wuerttemberg CPI.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German state of Baden-Wuerttemberg will publish consumer price data for January by around 0930 GMT, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>In December, the state reported that CPI climbed 1.2 percent from the year before and 0.2 percent from November 1996.</p>
<p>Baden-Wuerttemberg would be the first to report January CPI of four states that make up the preliminary west German consumer price report.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
</text>
